      "html": "<div id=\"step-q63873\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q63873\" questionid=\"63873\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 4</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>A park is estimated to have <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"53\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mn>000</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> rabbits. If their population decreases by <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"54\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> every year, what will the population of rabbits be approximately in ten years?</p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-63873-a\" class=\"questionWi